        "created_at": "2015-11-21T22:53:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When we saw Scholar's incap text on the Handelabra stream, I was confused by his incap powers. One of them was a basic one, like play a card or power, something like that, I forget exactly. Another one was all targets regain 1 hp.</p><p>But then the last one&nbsp; was \"Choose a player to discard 3 cards\".&nbsp; Is this just a sign that Scholar is a little mentally unhinged from knowing too much? or are there any situations where this could be useful? I don't have all the decks yet, so I don't remember if one of them could make use of that incap power, besides an unflipped Scholar of the Infinite himself.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:50.183Z",
